{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-02-10 18:00:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NOC) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (“NORTHROP” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: NOC) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS."}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-02-10 17:04:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, TRUSTED AND TOP RANKED INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION INVESTORS TO INQUIRE ABOUT CLASS ACTION INVESTIGATION – NOC', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION OF POTENTIAL SECURITIES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) RESULTING FROM ALLEGATIONS THAT NORTHROP MAY HAVE ISSUED MATERIALLY MISLEADING BUSINESS INFORMATION TO THE INVESTING PUBLIC.'}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-02-10 16:43:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION - NOC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 10, 2023) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION ("NORTHROP GRUMMAN" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: NOC). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER NORTHORP GRUMMAN AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-02-10 14:39:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NOC) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (“NORTHROP” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: NOC) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ON JANUARY 26, 2023, NORTHROP RELEASED ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS, DISCLOSING THAT THE COMPANY HAD RECEIVED A CRIMINAL SUBPOENA FROM THE U.S."}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-02-10 10:20:00', 'title': 'INVESTIGATION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES IT IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS AGAINST NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $NOC #NOC--THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES IT IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS AGAINST NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO CONTACT THE FIRM'}